{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"float:right\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_CyMO-6.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c3/2007_CyMO-6.PNG/250px-2007_CyMO-6.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c3/2007_CyMO-6.PNG/375px-2007_CyMO-6.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c3/2007_CyMO-6.PNG/500px-2007_CyMO-6.PNG 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/1/5a1788ec6ad85848dbaeacf2cea3bf65bc2fef76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle ABCD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square\" title=\"Square\">square</a> of side length 2 and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3951902c11a1cd39a091ea15f0f06cbc79095de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arc\" title=\"Arc\">arc</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circle\" title=\"Circle\">circle</a> with centre the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Midpoint\" title=\"Midpoint\">midpoint</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> of the side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radius\" title=\"Radius\">radius</a> 2. The length of the segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647db6af768bf9ddadd134cd1ceff5647ae6c958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle FD=GC=x$\" width=\"117\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/8/d28406416f0600ed3e293e2e09f3dbbf57359cdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac 14\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}2\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 2-\\sqrt{3}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\sqrt{3} - 1\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\sqrt{2} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"504\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5af67e4b0145ab44c66764c9cb1e6bf0493a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F,\\ G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> are on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f47f2a339e9024bd3ccc3e464974b4a16b9b8895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD},\\ \\overline{ BC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"19\" />, respectively) \n</p><p>Draw radii <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/7/917154d559202b774ad9544555a6062f7b96b2b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{KF},\\ \\overline{KG}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />, both with length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b0614160dfa3352f6f872c581da66770e53ac380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle AK = BK = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" />, so we form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangles</a>. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/7/b97553db6b4b28dcfc5b6db0b78699789f0f40b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF = BG = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />, and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81ffc6d7c169e0a5ce86238f83c38530c050b262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF = CG = 2 - \\sqrt{3} \\Longrightarrow \\mathrm{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"214\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1